## Interface: 11509, 20506
## Title: ZoneLore
## Notes: Shows additional lore about zones on the world map and minimap.|n|cffffcc00Beta:|r the narration is a proof-of-concept voice, being redesigned.
## Version: 0.4.3
## Author: rusty
## SavedVariables: ZoneLoreDB, ZoneLoreQueueDB
# ZoneLoreQueueDB held the ported player's own settings. The Spoken player owns those
# now; the variable stays declared so the migration can read it once.
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ZoneLoreCharDB
## LoadSavedVariablesFirst: true
# ^ load-bearing beyond convenience: the generated data files under Data/ ask
# Language.lua which language to build a table for, and it can only answer that
# early because ZoneLoreDB is already populated. Without this line every player
# silently reads English.
## OptionalDeps: Spoken, ZoneLoreAudio, ZoneLoreAudio64
# Spoken is the player this addon speaks through. Optional here so a hand-installed
# copy without it loads and says what is missing rather than failing to load at
# all; addon managers install it from the CurseForge dependency. The packs are not
# a registration mechanism either -- they register themselves into ZoneLoreAudioPacks
# and Audio.lua walks that on demand -- so this list is load order only.
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZoneLore\Textures\AddonIcon.tga
## X-License: Addon code MIT. Zone lore text from warcraft.wiki.gg, CC BY-SA 4.0.
## X-Credits: Lore text sourced from warcraft.wiki.gg contributors (CC BY-SA 4.0).

embeds.xml

